{
  "short_id": "short301",
  "episode_id": "PD-2026-076-morandi",
  "voice_stage": "master",
  "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
  "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
  "estimated_cost_usd": 0.273,
  "total_seconds": 53.97,
  "master": "E:\\pd-media\\episodes\\PD-2026-076-morandi\\06_voice\\master\\short301_vc_master_en_us_v002.mp3",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "chunk_id": "L1",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "On the first of August 2012, under a motorway viaduct in Genoa, an inspection recorded a beam with the concrete gone, the cables showing, and some of the wires broken.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 9.752,
      "seconds": 9.752,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:95745286095b2df73ffa464781cf30252c05f63cd35c883e5ab273e90c948358"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "chunk_id": "L2",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "Then the form asked for a number. The number written in the box was forty.",
      "start": 9.972,
      "end": 13.594,
      "seconds": 3.622,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:1a157cd0493411c6a186efcf4be2e2ddb068b394b4216c355807d3724bf8b1a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "chunk_id": "L3",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "In the company's own manual, broken wires in the prestressing steel are a seventy. And a seventy means measures up to closing the road.",
      "start": 13.814,
      "end": 21.616,
      "seconds": 7.802,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:aab43ca6f5423dbce8f4a91d013079687ee1374ad550448ae63a68a8746069e2"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "chunk_id": "L4",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "There was a manual, written by the company, that said what each number meant and what each number obliged them to do.",
      "start": 21.836,
      "end": 28.245,
      "seconds": 6.409,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:fc7159dbcbf35e93e0cb87ed7bf391b592fbb03e7d93d8be768d762068c132c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "chunk_id": "L5",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "In December 2006, steel bars severed by a slab failure. Scored forty.",
      "start": 28.465,
      "end": 33.109,
      "seconds": 4.644,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:53ac95f4294ea1c1e0d46998d2aab49dd0d1af7b72f6c2158b85daa13c1fa8e5"
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "chunk_id": "L6",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "In June 2013, inside the box girders, in the chambers you have to climb into: corroded cables. Scored fifty. It was found in 2013 and never repaired.",
      "start": 33.329,
      "end": 43.221,
      "seconds": 9.892,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:0d116875b2783910c963219b146f5fb5a8c53cc1a5955cc5ebdf0a5947cfe71e"
    },
    {
      "id": "L7",
      "chunk_id": "L7",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "Broken wires in the prestressing steel is the manual's own example of a seventy.",
      "start": 43.441,
      "end": 47.667,
      "seconds": 4.226,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:58a93c612a7bb42c62a3a9bef18051ed4e89863137e1e5785424d970583cb71f"
    },
    {
      "id": "L8",
      "chunk_id": "L8",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "It meant that the only way to know was to cut into it, and that the easier thing was always to write a number in a box.",
      "start": 47.887,
      "end": 53.971,
      "seconds": 6.084,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:325e86ece84f81d749f59808e1da91d8e76f9159b49a5a8807da036a140e0675"
    }
  ]
}
